### Create image file
POST {{host}}/api/sys/v1/mediaapi/image
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{mediaapiSysUserApiToken}}

// https://m.smedata.sk/api-media/media/image/sme/0/70/7008280/7008280.jpeg
// /sme/0/70/7008280/7008280.jpeg
